# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fluent — .gitignore
#
# Three kinds of thing stay out: what belongs to a MACHINE, what belongs to a
# CHILD, and what regenerates itself. The middle one is the one that matters:
# this repo grew alongside real learners, and a transcript or a profile backup
# is far harder to remove from a public history than to never commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- personal data: never commit -------------------------------------------
# Learner profiles live in ~/.fluent/<id>/ and never belong here, but backups
# and captured sessions have leaked into the tree over time.
obsolet/.backups/
**/learner-profile.json
!data-examples/learner-profile-template.json
**/session-log.json
**/mistakes-db.json
**/mastery-db.json
**/progress-db.json
**/spaced-repetition.json
!data-examples/*-template.json
results/
!results/README.md
!data/README.md
.records/
.metrics/
.daily/
.memories/
.update-state/
sessions/*.db
sessions/*.db-*
*.db.bak-*

# Working transcripts of real sessions, with the learners' names in them.
docs/sessio-*.json
docs/opencode-migration/*.json

# --- machine-specific -------------------------------------------------------
# The .env says which machine this is; the .env.<host> templates are committed
# so a new machine starts from one of them.
.env
!.env.railab
!.env.rapve
.flowed-active
.web-password
.web-password-default

# Text-to-speech: a binary and ~80 MB of voice models, installed per machine
# by scripts/fluent-tts.sh.
.fluent/_tts/

# --- regenerates itself -----------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- archived runtime -------------------------------------------------------
# 63 MB of the opencode build this project was freed from. Kept on disk for
# reference, not worth a repository.
obsolet/

# --- editor and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Marcador de mode dev, buit i local.
.fluent-dev

# --- scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
_to_delete/
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
/tmp/
